        <mxCell id="57" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 7&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Decision gate&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;If ≥5/6 APTO → scale to PSU.&lt;br/&gt;If &lt;5/6 → analyze crash JSONs, iterate to v0.6.47." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1940" y="1165" width="290" height="180" as="geometry"/>
