        <mxCell id="61" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;Production-Ready Fleet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;6 USB nodes APTO PSU verdict — ready for thesis production deployment&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Pattern documented for future boards. board_acceptance.py becomes the gate for every new board entering the fleet." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#9DC18E;strokeColor=#4D7A2D;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
